@startuml
title Green Rides State Transition Diagram

[*] --> Login

state Login
Login : entry / To Action
Login : do / Log in to the system
Login : exit / Username and password entered

state JourneyDetails <<choice>>
JourneyDetails : entry / Display journey details
JourneyDetails : do / Show route, distance, estimated time of arrival
JourneyDetails : exit / User selects driving mode or other options

state DrivingMode <<choice>>
DrivingMode : entry / Activate driving mode
DrivingMode : do / Start navigation and tracking
DrivingMode : exit / User chooses to stop driving mode

state PlaceToEat <<choice>>
PlaceToEat : entry / Select place to eat
PlaceToEat : do / View menu and place order if hungry
PlaceToEat : exit / User decides not to eat or completes order

state Accident <<choice>>
Accident : entry / Inform authorities in case of accident
Accident : do / Send notifications to emergency services
Accident : exit / Authorities notified, user safe

state Notification <<choice>>
Notification : entry / Send notifications during driving or accident
Notification : do / Alert user and relevant parties
Notification : exit / Notifications sent

state Feedback <<choice>>
Feedback : entry / Provide feedback upon completion of journey
Feedback : do / Rate experience and provide comments
Feedback : exit / User completes feedback, system updated

Login --> JourneyDetails : [login success]
JourneyDetails --> DrivingMode : [user selects driving mode]
DrivingMode --> PlaceToEat : [user chooses to eat]
PlaceToEat --> Accident : [user involved in accident]
Accident --> Notification : [accident reported]
Notification --> Feedback : [journey complete]

state Unloading <<choice>>
Unloading : entry / User completes journey, system unloads
Unloading : do / Save data, update user profile
Unloading : exit / System terminates

Feedback --> Unloading : [user provides feedback]
Unloading --> [*] : [system terminated]

@enduml
